Translation patch: `StmtBulkExecuteParamType::from_value`, `StmtBulkExecuteParamValue::new` (parameter names)

Change: The parameter `value` becomes `v` (and the field initialiser `value` becomes `value: v`).
Why: As in patch 59: Aeneas names the local `value`, which shadows the Lean namespace `value` in the generated `match` patterns (`value.Value.NULL`), so the Lean does not elaborate.
Behaviour: Identical: renaming only.

